# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, on every platform;
# core.autocrlf does not override this. It matters beyond taste: `. .env.test` in a
# shell keeps the CR in each value, and Docker copies the working tree into the images.
# The code and the tests still have to cope with a CRLF checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf

# cmd.exe needs CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
